WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,350
Wear this quiet moon-white color when taking a shower

2
00:00:02,350 --> 00:00:04,350
Hahaha great

3
00:00:04,350 --> 00:00:05,850
I suddenly remembered that there was something else

4
00:00:05,850 --> 00:00:07,350
I'll come back when your heir apparent comes back.

5
00:00:07,350 --> 00:00:12,200
No wonder everyone said that the doctor who accompanied the miracle doctor had a weird temper.

6
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:13,700
Really ill

7
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:19,570
Dad, stop looking.

8
00:00:19,570 --> 00:00:24,490
I'll come back in a few days to see how you do

9
00:00:24,490 --> 00:00:25,890
Be willing to admit defeat

10
00:00:25,890 --> 00:00:28,790
I said in the morning that he would leave with others after lunch

11
00:00:28,790 --> 00:00:29,790
You still don’t believe it

12
00:00:29,790 --> 00:00:30,890
You have to bet with me

13
00:00:30,890 --> 00:00:33,180
There is no way for a female college student to stay in college.

14
00:00:33,180 --> 00:00:35,730
