16
00:00:38,730 --> 00:00:40,730
I only know that the snow fell early this year

17
00:00:40,730 --> 00:00:42,730
I'm afraid this winter won't be easy

18
00:00:42,730 --> 00:00:44,830
If you really lose your father

19
00:00:44,830 --> 00:00:46,830
I don’t know how many people will die yet

20
00:00:46,830 --> 00:00:48,020
earthquake disaster

21
00:00:48,020 --> 00:00:50,020
The Song family must hurry up and do it
